ordinates.MeshFluxHeight.strip_point","Breakdown.CellCert.CellCoordinates.MeshFluxHeight.strip_split","Breakdown.CellCert.CellCoordinates.MeshFluxHeight.term_integrable","Breakdown.CellCert.CellCoordinates.MeshSkeletonSplitInternal.height_int","Breakdown.CellCert.CellCoordinates.MeshSkeletonSplitInternal.height_term_eq","Breakdown.CellCert.CellCoordinates.MeshSkeletonSplitInternal.hsm_congr","Breakdown.CellCert.CellCoordinates.MeshSkeletonSplitInternal.hsm_eq","Breakdown.CellCert.CellCoordinates.MeshSkeletonSplitInternal.hsm_lin","Breakdown.CellCert.CellCoordinates.MeshSkeletonSplitInternal.hsm_smul","Breakdown.CellCert.CellCoordinates.MeshStreamInd.strip_tent","Breakdown.CellCert.CellCoordinates.MeshStreamInd.term_integrableOn","Breakdown.CellCert.CellFormula.heightStrip_tent","Breakdown.CellCert.CellFormula.heightStrip_tent_zero","Breakdown.CellCert.CellFormula.heightTerm_integrableOn","Breakdown.CertCell.Assembly.Internal.KeyFlux.height_key","Breakdown.CertCell.Assembly.Internal.KeyFlux.strip_split","Breakdown.CertCell.Assembly.Internal.KeyFlux.strip_term_eq","Breakdown.CertCell.Assembly.Internal.KeySplit.height_term_int","Breakdown.CertCell.Assembly.Internal.KeySplit.stripJ_lin","Breakdown.CertCell.Assembly.Internal.KeySplit.term_int"],"uses":[],"written":"heightStripTerm"}],"imports":["Breakdown.FracCell.FormulaDataDefs"],"module":"Breakdown.FracCell.SegmentPairDefs","path":"Breakdown/FracCell/SegmentPairDefs.lean","sha256":"91969f43b0bd00e539e63306cc97c07d50ba3f50ef97b305fc5e7f9cb47c49e6","source":"import Breakdown.FracCell.FormulaDataDefs\n\nopen MeasureTheory\nopen scoped ContDiff\n\nnoncomputable section\n\nnamespace Breakdown.CellCert.CellFormula\n\nopen SteadyCert Assembly CellAnalysis\n\ndef IsRadialWeakPair (F dF : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) : Prop :=\n  (∀ R Z : ℝ, IntegrableOn F (Set.Icc 0 R ×ˢ Set.Icc (-Z) Z) ∧\n      IntegrableOn (fun p => (p.1 : ℂ) * dF p) (Set.Icc 0 R ×ˢ Set.Icc (-Z) Z)) ∧\n  (∀ δ R Z : ℝ, 0 < δ → IntegrableOn dF (Set.Icc δ R ×ˢ Set.Icc (-Z) Z)) ∧\n  ∀ ψ : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ ψ → HasCompactSupport ψ → (∀ p ∈ tsupport ψ, 0 < p.1) →\n    ∫ p, ((fderiv ℝ ψ p (1, 0) : ℝ) : ℂ) * F p = -∫ p, (ψ p : ℂ) * dF p\n\ndef IsHeightWeakPair (wt : ℝ → ℝ) (F dF : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) : Prop :=\n  (∀ R Z : ℝ, IntegrableOn (fun p => (wt p.1 : ℂ) * F p) (Set.Icc (-R) R ×ˢ Set.Icc (-Z) Z) ∧\n      IntegrableOn (fun p => (wt p.1 : ℂ) * dF p) (Set.Icc (-R) R ×ˢ Set.Icc (-Z) Z)) ∧\n  (∀ δ R Z : ℝ, 0 < δ →\n      IntegrableOn F {p : ℝ × ℝ | δ ≤ |p.1| ∧ |p.1| ≤ R ∧ |p.2| ≤ Z} ∧\n      IntegrableOn dF {p : ℝ × ℝ | δ ≤ |p.1| ∧ |p.1| ≤ R ∧ |p.2| ≤ Z}) ∧\n  ∀ ψ : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ ψ → HasCompactSupport ψ → (∀ p ∈ tsupport ψ, p.1 ≠ 0) →\n    ∫ p, ((fderiv ℝ ψ p (0, 1) : ℝ) : ℂ) * F p = -∫ p, (ψ p : ℂ) * dF p\n\ndef radialStripTerm (c o : ℝ) (F dF : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) (t : ℝ → ℝ) (p : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ :=\n  ((((1 / (c - o) : ℝ)) : ℂ) * F p + (((p.1 - o) / (c - o) : ℝ) : ℂ) * dF p) * ((t p.2 : ℝ) : ℂ)\n\ndef heightStripTerm (c o : ℝ) (wt : ℝ → ℝ) (F dF : ℝ × ℝ → ℂ) (t : ℝ → ℝ) (p : ℝ × ℝ) : ℂ :=\n  ((((1 / (c - o) : ℝ)) : ℂ) * F p + (((p.2 - o) / (c - o) : ℝ) : ℂ) * dF p) * ((wt p.1 * t p.1 : ℝ) : ℂ)\n\nend Breakdown.CellCert.CellFormula\n"}